1
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:45,550
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:46,920
[Episode 33]

3
00:00:46,950 --> 00:00:47,440
[Adapted from Migu's novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Writer: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:49,320
Go with Daddy.

6
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:50,480
Bye-bye.

7
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:54,360
Oh, teacher.

8
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:56,060
I'm here to pick up Xiao He.

9
00:00:56,340 --> 00:00:57,200
Nianhe?

10
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:59,080
Nianhe was already picked up by her uncle.

11
00:00:59,080 --> 00:01:00,260
He just left not long ago.

12
00:01:00,260 --> 00:01:00,640
Okay.

13
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:01,720
Thank you. I got it.

14
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:06,240
Hello?

15
00:01:06,850 --> 00:01:07,640
Yi Muyang.

16
00:01:08,039 --> 00:01:09,480
You should be resting. Why did you
pick up Xiao He again?

17
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:10,120
where did you take Xiao He

18
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:11,250
Where did you two go?

19
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:12,539
I've been wronged!

20
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:14,039
My dad was watching. I really didn't
go anywhere today.

21
00:01:14,039 --> 00:01:15,370
I really didn't go anywhere today.

22
00:01:15,370 --> 00:01:16,570
Then where's Xiao He?

23
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:18,160
Is Xiao He missing?

24
00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:24,280
[Delicious ice cream] [Second half price]

25
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:24,200
Xiao He.

26
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:26,560
You're so little—

27
00:01:26,580 --> 00:01:28,180
can you really eat ice cream?

28
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:28,840
Of course.

29
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:30,240
I want blueberry flavor.

30
00:01:42,460 --> 00:01:43,200
Is it good?

31
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:44,080
Mm.

32
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:45,240
Shu Nianhe.

33
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:51,560
[Delicious ice cream] [Second half price]

34
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:51,680
What did Mom tell you?

35
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:53,039
Don't casually eat things

36
00:01:53,039 --> 00:01:54,240
strangers give you.

37
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:56,570
And never casually go with strangers.

38
00:01:57,479 --> 00:02:00,160
But Mom, you know Uncle Zhuo.

39
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:02,440
That still doesn't make it okay.

40
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:03,880
Only people you're very close to

41
00:02:03,880 --> 00:02:04,880
can be trusted.

42
00:02:05,240 --> 00:02:06,080
But Mom,

43
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:08,440
you often look at Uncle Zhuo's photos.

44
00:02:09,289 --> 00:02:10,690
Does that count as close?

45
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,160
What?

46
00:02:19,180 --> 00:02:20,200
Backpack.

47
00:02:25,200 --> 00:02:26,720
Mr. Zhuo, what does this mean?

48
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:28,400
Trying to use personal connections

49
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:30,200
to influence my work decisions?

50
00:02:32,220 --> 00:02:34,520
It really was just a coincidence
that I picked her up.

51
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:36,400
Xiao He had been waiting at
the teacher's place for a long time,

52
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:37,530
so I brought her out.

53
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:38,880
No matter what,

54
00:02:39,040 --> 00:02:39,760
Zhuo Yu'an,

55
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:41,560
don't drag my child

56
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:43,240
into whatever is between us.

57
00:02:56,290 --> 00:02:57,240
Xiao He,

58
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,120
are you okay?

59
00:03:01,570 --> 00:03:02,520
Uncle Zhuo,

60
00:03:02,540 --> 00:03:03,600
thank you.

61
00:03:04,170 --> 00:03:05,520
Are you okay?

62
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:14,880
Wow.

63
00:03:15,030 --> 00:03:16,079
It hurts so much.

64
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:17,600
Wow.

65
00:03:31,079 --> 00:03:31,640
My—

66
00:03:31,810 --> 00:03:34,140
why is my shoulder starting to hurt again?

67
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:35,579
That's enough.

68
00:03:35,670 --> 00:03:36,640
Stop acting.

69
00:03:38,829 --> 00:03:40,200
Hey, Tinglan.

70
00:03:40,250 --> 00:03:41,810
You used to care about me so much.

71
00:03:41,810 --> 00:03:42,560
If I got even a tiny injury,

72
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:44,420
you'd bandage it for me yourself.

73
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:47,290
You said it yourself—that was before.

74
00:03:54,650 --> 00:03:56,110
Shu Nianhe, sit properly.

75
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:03,540
I've taken Zhuoyuan Tech's case.

76
00:04:04,920 --> 00:04:06,050
Lawyer Sun is right.

77
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:08,600
Since I don't have experience
winning cases,

78
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:09,640
and this case is

79
00:04:09,640 --> 00:04:10,880
highly watched in the industry,

80
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:12,640
there's no reason not to take it.

81
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:14,570
As for Mr. Zhuo's work principles,

82
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:16,339
I will strictly abide by them.

83
00:04:17,760 --> 00:04:19,089
I hope Mr. Zhuo will too.

84
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:22,520
Ouch.

85
00:04:23,610 --> 00:04:24,920
It still hurts so much.

86
00:04:32,180 --> 00:04:34,860
[Outpatient]

87
00:04:38,159 --> 00:04:39,000
Are you alright now?

88
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,330
What did the doctor say?

89
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:41,600
If there's nothing else,

90
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:43,200
I'll take Xiao He home first.

91
00:04:43,390 --> 00:04:44,320
Tinglan.

92
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,280
I still have a project procedure

93
00:04:48,280 --> 00:04:49,340
to go over with you.

94
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,440
Now?

95
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:51,720
Mm.

96
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:52,920
Yes.

97
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,159
Tinglan.

98
00:04:57,880 --> 00:04:58,680
Grandpa.

99
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,120
Hey.

100
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,610
Little darling Nianhe.

101
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:02,010
Tinglan, give me a hand.

102
00:05:02,370 --> 00:05:03,080
Uncle Yi.

103
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:04,720
How's your health lately?

104
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:05,760
Great!

105
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:06,800
I've already pushed this kid

106
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:08,430
around the ward in a big circle.

107
00:05:08,430 --> 00:05:09,690
Not even out of breath.

108
00:05:10,150 --> 00:05:10,860
Tinglan,

109
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,440
I told you I'm fine.

110
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:14,640
No need to come to the hospital to see me.

111
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,480
Mr. Zhuo got hurt.

112
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:26,080
We took him to get it treated.

113
00:05:28,630 --> 00:05:30,280
What happened to Mr. Zhuo?

114
00:05:31,280 --> 00:05:32,840
Even a CEO gets hurt?

115
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:37,490
I accidentally scratched myself.

116
00:05:37,490 --> 00:05:39,090
Tinglan was worried about me

117
00:05:39,770 --> 00:05:42,570
and insisted on coming along while
I got bandaged.

118
00:05:46,580 --> 00:05:47,880
That's our Tinglan.

119
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:49,440
Whether it's family

120
00:05:49,460 --> 00:05:50,960
or colleagues,

121
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:53,570
she's equally kind and warm-hearted.

122
00:05:58,470 --> 00:05:59,440
Naturally.

123
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:03,800
Tinglan,

124
00:06:06,210 --> 00:06:07,700
I feel like my

125
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,640
arm still hurts a bit.

126
00:06:10,450 --> 00:06:11,600
Did the doctor just say

127
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:13,000
I need another X-ray?

128
00:06:14,060 --> 00:06:16,040
Why is my leg starting to hurt too?

129
00:06:17,310 --> 00:06:18,560
It's fine, Tinglan.

130
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,820
You go with Mr. Zhuo first.

131
00:06:20,850 --> 00:06:21,680
I—

132
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,240
I might be used to it.

133
00:06:24,990 --> 00:06:25,920
Tinglan,

134
00:06:26,270 --> 00:06:27,320
I think I have low blood sugar.

135
00:06:27,320 --> 00:06:28,250
What's going on?

136
00:06:28,620 --> 00:06:29,600
Tinglan.

137
00:06:33,270 --> 00:06:35,200
Then it's really been tough on you.

138
00:06:35,310 --> 00:06:37,240
Every day you have to take care of

139
00:06:37,420 --> 00:06:38,460
the frail and sickly

140
00:06:38,460 --> 00:06:39,790
and irrelevant people.

141
00:06:58,270 --> 00:06:59,240
Teacher said

142
00:06:59,270 --> 00:07:00,960
kids who behave well

143
00:07:00,960 --> 00:07:03,320
can get a little red flower as a reward.

144
00:07:03,490 --> 00:07:05,560
I'll give you my little red flower.

145
00:07:07,740 --> 00:07:08,920
Pain, fly away.

146
00:07:10,020 --> 00:07:11,000
Thank you.

147
00:07:11,380 --> 00:07:12,560
Thank you, Nianhe.

148
00:07:27,030 --> 00:07:28,680
Pain, fly away.

149
00:07:33,450 --> 00:07:34,590
Alright, alright.

150
00:07:34,610 --> 00:07:35,620
How old are you all?

151
00:07:35,620 --> 00:07:37,640
Still playing these childish tricks.

152
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:39,040
I'll push him back first.

153
00:07:39,640 --> 00:07:40,840
Bye, Grandpa.

154
00:07:40,860 --> 00:07:42,080
Bye, Nianhe.

155
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:43,400
Okay.

156
00:07:49,210 --> 00:07:50,320
You—

157
00:07:50,640 --> 00:07:51,800
stop always doing these things

158
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:53,270
that put others in awkward positions.

159
00:07:53,270 --> 00:07:55,830
That's not how you win a girl over.

160
00:07:59,430 --> 00:08:00,640
If there's nothing else,

161
00:08:00,640 --> 00:08:02,200
I'll take Xiao He and go first.

162
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:02,840
Tinglan.

163
00:08:07,110 --> 00:08:08,080
I remember

164
00:08:08,100 --> 00:08:09,130
Nianhe's kindergarten

165
00:08:09,130 --> 00:08:10,700
is holding a parent-child sports day.

166
00:08:10,700 --> 00:08:12,360
I don't think there is no

167
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,330
any suitable person to attend.

168
00:08:13,330 --> 00:08:15,440
So how about I go in their place—

169
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:17,260
Don't even think about it.

170
00:08:33,010 --> 00:08:39,289
[Hua'an City Zhihang Kindergarten]

171
00:08:34,559 --> 00:08:35,799
School's out!

172
00:08:44,230 --> 00:08:44,960
Xiao He.

173
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,870
Want me to take you to the pet store?

174
00:08:46,870 --> 00:08:47,550
Okay.

175
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:48,530
Let's go.

176
00:09:00,450 --> 00:09:02,440
Forgot what you promised again.

177
00:09:06,660 --> 00:09:07,720
[Puff Pets]

178
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:11,440
[Open]

179
00:09:09,470 --> 00:09:10,400
Xiao He.

180
00:09:10,690 --> 00:09:11,720
Do you like it?

181
00:09:11,780 --> 00:09:12,880
I like it.

182
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:16,600
Thank you, Uncle, for bringing me
to see the puppies.

183
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:18,640
Let me tell Uncle a secret.

184
00:09:25,260 --> 00:09:26,220
Okay.

185
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:28,220
Uncle knows.

186
00:09:30,380 --> 00:09:32,180
So, shall we go in and take a look?

187
00:09:33,160 --> 00:09:36,040
But I still need to ask Mom first.

188
00:09:36,070 --> 00:09:37,440
Shu Nianhe.

189
00:09:38,300 --> 00:09:41,210
[Open]

190
00:09:38,810 --> 00:09:40,870
You still remember you need to ask me?

191
00:09:41,430 --> 00:09:43,600
Mom.

192
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:45,040
Mom, I'm sorry.

193
00:09:49,550 --> 00:09:51,610
I really can't do anything about you.

194
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:59,390
[Open]

195
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:59,280
Xiao He is young, so fine.

196
00:09:59,830 --> 00:10:00,840
But Zhuo Yu'an,

197
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:02,960
you're ignoring my words too?

198
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:05,670
You spoil her every day,

199
00:10:05,690 --> 00:10:08,960
spoiling her wild.

200
00:10:09,260 --> 00:10:10,460
Xiao He won't be wild.

201
00:10:25,170 --> 00:10:26,280
Backpack.

202
00:10:48,380 --> 00:10:49,340
Let's go.

203
00:10:49,890 --> 00:10:50,800
Shu Tinglan.

204
00:10:53,140 --> 00:10:54,040
Can you give me

205
00:10:54,040 --> 00:10:55,170
a way to contact you?

206
00:10:55,750 --> 00:10:59,350
I don't want to have to use the work email
every time I look for you.

207
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:01,280
With your capability,

208
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:02,140
you can find it

209
00:11:02,170 --> 00:11:03,600
without me giving it to you.

210
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,100
Let's go.

211
00:11:04,100 --> 00:11:04,920
Xiao He, let's go home.
